  "content": "Amitāyus, the principal guide of the world,Who subdues all forms of untimely death,Refuge for those who suffer without a protector,To the Buddha Amitāyus, I prostrate.Oṃ amaraṇi jīvantīye svāhā.When the signs of untimely death are seen,May I immediately see the form of the Protector Amitāyus clearly,And having vanquished the Lord of Death,May I swiftly attain the state of an immortal vidyādhara.",
